    "name": "Levitate Elixirs-Spiced Pineapple & Coconut",
    "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">INGREDIENTS: PINEAPPLE JUICE,PURIFIED WATER, WHITE WINE VINEGAR, APPLE CIDER VINEGAR, RAW WILLAMETTE VALLEY HONEY, ORGANIC CANE SUGAR, PROPRIETARY HERBAL EXTRACT BLEND OF (RED PANAX</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">GINSENG, LINDEN*, ASHWAGANDHA*, CANE ETHANOL*, DISTILLED WATER), GUAYUSA EXTRACT*, CITRIC ACID, LTHEANINE, POTASSIUM SORBATE, VITAMIN C AS ASCORBIC ACID, VANILLA &amp; COCONUT EXTRACT (VANILLA BEAN EXTRACTIVES IN WATER, COCONUT EXTRACTIVES, NATURAL FLAVORS, ETHANOL), STEVIA, SEA SALT, DISODIUM EDTA &amp; SPICES *=ORGANIC</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Just pour 3 oz of chilled elixir over ice, add seltzer, Garnish &amp; voila! You’re done!</span></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">750 ml / 25.4 fl oz</span></p>",
